# Upstream paths the fork deletes. fork-sync.sh deletes them again after
# every merge, so upstream editing them is never a conflict.
# Upstream's CI, release and release-please workflows; the fork builds and
# releases with Woodpecker (.woodpecker/). Only these three: the fork keeps
# upstream's other .github files as they are.
.github/workflows/ci.yaml
.github/workflows/release.yml
.github/workflows/release-please.yml
release-please-config.json
.release-please-manifest.json
